Package: gibbsTI
Title: Calibrated Gibbs Posteriors for Tolerance Intervals
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Tony", "Pourmohamad", 
    email = "tpourmohamad@gmail.com", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for constructing one-sided and two-sided
    nonparametric tolerance intervals using calibrated Gibbs posteriors.
    The methods target population quantiles and content levels while
    achieving nominal frequentist coverage through data-driven
    calibration.
